{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55622","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 二十 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 二十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自甘疎拙懒经营，大道从来戒满盈。\n但起贪心迷有限，谁能触目悟无生。\n云融远景危峰小，风戛寒溪野艇横。\n禅後不妨敷六义。\n只图歌出野人情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55622.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55622","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}